{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udeab Reject Mindless Stats, Return to Combat Instincts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-tier equipment won't save your life, but your reactions will.</strong> Face overwhelming pressure of massive BOSSes and experience &quot;Souls-like&quot; hardcore gameplay\u2014observe BOSS's attack windup, find openings, rather than just watching HP bars exchange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/a530f861c8f1dfd13d8a7ea4c391aa47.poster.avif?t=1768991217\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/a530f861c8f1dfd13d8a7ea4c391aa47.webm?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/a530f861c8f1dfd13d8a7ea4c391aa47.mp4?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/121124f5f8a94dbd1a29e8b6766d4e3c.poster.avif?t=1768991217\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/121124f5f8a94dbd1a29e8b6766d4e3c.webm?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/121124f5f8a94dbd1a29e8b6766d4e3c.mp4?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u23f3 God-View Dimensional Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot control every step of your characters, but you can <strong>freeze their time</strong>. Use the exclusive <strong>time stop mechanism</strong> to pause at the very last second before battle collapses. Reroute paths, connect divine beams, trigger elemental reactions. Every click you make is a direct reshaping of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/d742642ff981847938ade458a004ca22.poster.avif?t=1768991217\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/d742642ff981847938ade458a004ca22.webm?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/d742642ff981847938ade458a004ca22.mp4?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udca5 Violent Aesthetics of Physical Laws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to memorize complex formulas\u2014trust your intuition: use inertia to knock back light enemies with high-speed charges; use heavy attacks to interrupt massive BOSS balance. This is not just a duel of magic, but <strong>violent aesthetics of physical laws</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/0301629cccdf565fc98a57ef87235263.poster.avif?t=1768991217\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/0301629cccdf565fc98a57ef87235263.webm?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/0301629cccdf565fc98a57ef87235263.mp4?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u267e\ufe0f Boundless Evolution: Infinite Builds Breaking Dimensions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget those narrow linear skill trees. Here, growth isn't about stat stacking\u2014it's about recompiling <strong>&quot;physical laws&quot;</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Tiling:</strong> Talent clusters periodically manifest on an infinite 2D plane following unique patterns. <strong>No invisible walls, no dead ends</strong>. Drag in any direction to find critical node projections that can change your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/69996a97207e890dc557fd785e9d14cf.poster.avif?t=1768991217\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/69996a97207e890dc557fd785e9d14cf.webm?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/69996a97207e890dc557fd785e9d14cf.mp4?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics as Privilege:</strong> Every node in the talent web is an <strong>open permission</strong> for a world law. All mechanics (like &quot;Knockback&quot;, &quot;Summon&quot;, &quot;Element&quot;) are shared across all characters. Warriors naturally have &quot;Knockback&quot; skills to directly connect to &quot;Knockback build&quot;; but other characters aren't isolated from it\u2014as long as you find the correct <strong>path</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Logic Bridging:</strong> This is the soul of builds. Want a mage to master the warrior's &quot;Knockback build&quot;? Seek those &quot;conversion nodes&quot;<strong>\u2014forcefully converting the [high impact] trait inherent to mage skills into [Knockback] effects. Through logical translation and bridging, you can create <strong>bizarre god-tier builds</strong> that defy class conventions yet remain logically consistent.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/f770e8b973c9bb149f8c85e186c6c4ca.poster.avif?t=1768991217\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/f770e8b973c9bb149f8c85e186c6c4ca.webm?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/extras/f770e8b973c9bb149f8c85e186c6c4ca.mp4?t=1768991217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4088320?t=1768991217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/b2e3194e0e86f523139e3cc83b63fff352304cba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768991217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/77ea90069d96ac7259c96f07045e38d62b3d343a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768991217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088320/77ea90069d96ac7259c96f07045e38d62b3d343a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768991217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","